For a second, you're confused to see Centurio Clavius at this place. Clavius
was your first commanding officer in the Order of Soldiers. You go faster and
touch him on his shoulder. Clavius turns around and once he recognizes you,
he smiles broadly. "Oh, it's you! We haven't met for awhile." Clavius takes
your hand. "How are you?"

You look at the floor, silently. Seeing Clavius suddenly evoked memories of a
sad incident that happenend some years ago. Clavius nods slowly. "I see. You
are still mourning." The centurio sighs. "I understand that. It's a shame."
So he knows what he reminds you of. The death of Aneas, one of your comrades,
and your best friend. Murdered some years ago, at exactly this place, the
catacombs of Enoa, during a journey that should have been a search for calm
and peace.

"Look. We never stopped investigating in this case. Over the last months, we
followed a woman called Ronda Gardner. Since some years, she's a member of a
rather new cult. We have evidence that she is responsible for the death of
Aneas--the boy was probably simply in the wrong place at the wrong time, but
Gardner must have seen him as a danger--for whatever plans she had back then."
Your eyes open widely. Clavius continues: "Gardner hides somewhere in these
Catacombs. And I'm here to bring her to justice--finally, after all the time."